<title>USA: Omaha hogs off $1.00/1.50 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs off $1.00/1.50 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 to</p>
<p>$1.50 lower. Top $60.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-3    230-260 lbs    60.00-60.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    260-290 lbs    58.50-60.00</p>
<p>Sows Steady to 1.00 lower. Top 54.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-450 lbs    49.50-50.50</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    51.00-51.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs    53.00-54.00</p>
